<title>USA: Harcor energy decides to sell company.</title>
<headline>Harcor energy decides to sell company.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>HarCor Energy Inc said Monday its board of directors has concluded that the sale of the entire company is the most appropriate avenue for maximizing shareholder values.</p>
<p>As previously announced, HarCor has engaged Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc as the lead manager for this process.</p>
<p>HarCor is a Houston-based independent energy company pursuing risk-managed oil and gas acquisitions.</p>
</text>
